### Release Timeline

| Week | Deliverable                      |
| ---- | -------------------------------- |
| 1    | Persistent overlay + OCR         |
| 2    | Persona-based AI replies         |
| 3    | Reply insertion + UI polish      |
| 4    | Adaptive learning + Beta release |

---

### Outcome

After four weeks, Durga AI Float Assistant will:

* Stay active persistently on Android
* Read chat context in real time
* Generate persona-based natural replies
* Insert or paste replies seamlessly
* Adapt continuously from user behavior
